sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Relay
    participant E as Entry nodes<br/>(k, rotating, dialed out)
    participant N as Every other node

    R->>E: announcement, signed by the relay:<br/>the client's signed message, block B's hash,<br/>and the bundle itself if small, else its hash
    E->>N: passed on over the existing MPC mesh
    N->>R: bundle too big to travel inline:<br/>GET /bundle/(hash), CDN-cacheable
